<http://data.silknow.org/object/80153c64-d94b-3076-94d0-85926aae11ec/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Tapestry woven in wool and silk. On the left is a balustrade decorated with orange trees in pots. Before it stands a goddess, probably Ceres, with a cornucopia with a sheaf of wheat in a cornucopia while she holds a torch in her right hand. By her are three women, two with baskets of flowers and fruit and the other with a sheaf of wheat. In the background on the right is a large chateau, before which is a fountain and people on a picnic. A landscape with houses is in the distance."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/80153c64-d94b-3076-94d0-85926aae11ec> .

